  "changelog": "Gopls package 0.1.0\n\nMinimum Cadencr application version: 0.16.1. This release publishes package assets only. Production marketplace catalog admission, the LSP revocation feed and the desktop release remain separate rollout steps.\n\nCanonical archive and runtime qualification: https://github.com/merkr-software/CadencR/actions/runs/42215738947\n\nPackaged binary deployment floors: macOS ARM 12.0.0, macOS Intel 12.0.0. Runtime qualification used macOS 15 on both architectures and Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 x86_64; older OS runtime certification and application OS support are separate. Project intelligence requires a compatible Go project toolchain. Qualification used the pinned Go 1.26.10 toolchain.\n\n<!-- cadencr-publication-binding:sha256:322c65de024d33cd6bf3ad20c6506b6f04b2856b30181dc46ef5063efbfaa1e6 -->"
